WEBVTT

00:00:00.156 --> 00:00:04.572
The HTTP surface of naimix.

00:00:04.572 --> 00:00:07.966
Call a mounted route.

00:00:07.966 --> 00:00:10.446
Unknown paths return a JSON 404.

00:00:10.446 --> 00:00:15.136
Protected routes need a session.

00:00:15.136 --> 00:00:18.808
Log in to get an opaque session token.

00:00:18.808 --> 00:00:22.888
Send it as a bearer token.

00:00:22.888 --> 00:00:27.810
The Ops Console API uses its own token.

00:00:27.812 --> 00:00:38.023
The main prefixes at a glance.
